    {
      "source": "Extension of the <code>ElasticsearchClient</code> class that implements <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/AutoCloseable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>AutoCloseable</code></a>. As the underlying\n<code>RestClient</code> must be closed properly this is handled in the <a href=\"#close()\"><code>close()</code></a> method.",
      "translation": "扩展了实现 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/AutoCloseable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>AutoCloseable</code></a> 的 <code>ElasticsearchClient</code> 类。由于底层的 <code>RestClient</code> 必须正确关闭，因此该操作在 <a href=\"#close()\"><code>close()</code></a> 方法中处理。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
